@ryofurue this PR standardise all RasterStack, Raster and LookupArray metadata to be `Metadata{SOURCE,Dict{String,Any}}`.

The intention is to allow more strings keys that CF standards allow that are either awkward or impossible with `Symbol` keys. It's also a breaking change that will require a minor version bump. See also: https://github.com/rafaqz/DimensionalData.jl/issues/406

What is further needed is to define the lists of allowed keys for all metadata subtypes, and allow users to use a plain `Dict` to define keys, that we can check against allowed keys to warn on mistakes. 

@ryoforue if you have any time to collate these allowed key/value combinations from the CF standards, GDAL and Rs GRI/GRI files, or for even some of these types, we could get started on implementing proper metadata checking, conversion, and writing (as outlined in #3 the oldest open issue here!). Seems I haven't found time to do it in the last 3 years :sweat_smile:

